redis-cli
List all Sidekiq keys/Check Sidekiq Queues in Redis:	keys *sidekiq*
Check running jobs:	hgetall sidekiq:workers
Check failed jobs:	lrange sidekiq:retry 0 -1
Check dead jobs:	lrange sidekiq:dead 0 -1
Check jobs in a queue:	lrange sidekiq:queue:default 0 -1